Skills specialist owns the `SKILLS` array and `skill-mods.ts` only. Do not edit `SPECIALIZATIONS` or spec helpers — that is the Specialization specialist (`.cursor/rules/td2-specs.mdc`).

Skills are tiles (`id`, name, category, description). Soft `assumed` only as a sheet hint while equipped. Mods are **skill-local**, never character-wide.

Official Y8S3 “skill base values and Skill Tier scaling” notes are **Conflict / PvP Dark Zone only**. Do not apply them to this PvE sheet.

Do not regress:

- Live variants that must exist: Banshee Pulse, Achilles Pulse, Shrapnel Trap, Precision Smart Cover, Fortified Smart Cover.
- Chem heal variant name is **Reinforcer Chem Launcher** (keep id `repair-chem`).
- TD2 sticky pool is Burn / EMP / Explosive — **no Flashbang Sticky** (Division 1 leftover).
- Booster Hive: weapon handling, hazard protection, melee (not “speed and damage”).
- Banshee Coil: Cone Size +7.5%. Gunner Directional Transmitter also on Banshee.
- Smart Cover slots: Smart Launcher + Smart Projectile. Namu lists lines but not max % — use family-typical Gear 2.0 caps (7.5% duration/haste/radius, 5% unique lines) and say so.
- Other Gear 2.0 max rolls: Namu level 40 tables.

Do not add character-wide burn stats for Firewall season synergy. `npm test` after edits.
